WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.200
I am 55 years old.

2
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.400
I suffered from erectile dysfunction for about 5 years.

3
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.500
Nothing could help me,

4
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.000
not the pills and not the other treatments.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.900
After a while, I tried PEMF,

6
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:21.600
and after about 15 treatments, I'm back to function.

7
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.600
My wife thanks me, and thanks the technology very much.
